ust be exercised by more  than reddit  and more than marching it's a full  global civil rights movement  we're on this journey together and it's  not over  57 years later still a lot of work to be  done  as the civil rights movement is moving  forward like the bus is following  we have only just begun our journey has  not ended yet  we will continue amplifying the voices  of the unheard it's not a moment  at all going into the communities and  let the world know that  these are the people that make america  great carry on on three  one two three

